    <briefdescription>
<para>Fixed-size, owned array of <computeroutput><ref refid="class_m2_1_1_a_ring_tower_a0b8fb52a03094a0584d37b7741fc1dc7_1a0b8fb52a03094a0584d37b7741fc1dc7" kindref="member">ElementType</ref></computeroutput>s for the linear-algebra templates that want a flat buffer of tower-polynomial slots. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Backed by a <computeroutput>std::unique_ptr&lt;<ref refid="class_m2_1_1_a_ring_tower_a0b8fb52a03094a0584d37b7741fc1dc7_1a0b8fb52a03094a0584d37b7741fc1dc7" kindref="member">ElementType</ref>[]&gt;</computeroutput>. Slots are zero-initialised at construction and cleared through <computeroutput><ref refid="class_m2_1_1_a_ring_tower_a937e9cb9dcbb30e4946fe3c4c57243aa_1a937e9cb9dcbb30e4946fe3c4c57243aa" kindref="member">ARingTower::clear</ref></computeroutput> in the destructor, so the array owns its tower polynomials. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
